flowchart TD
    E["the own frame's start:<br/>EntryBB.getFirstInsertionPt()"] --> A0["trace_args(arg 0)"]
    A0 --> A1["trace_args(arg 1)"]
    A1 --> IB["an inlined frame's start:<br/>legalInsertionPt() inside the<br/>callee's instruction range"]
    IB --> C0["trace_args(arg 0)<br/>!dbg names the callee"]
    C0 --> BR{"branch"}
    BR --> B1["basic block A"]
    BR --> B2["basic block B"]
    BR --> B3["basic block C"]
    B1 --> R1["trace_ret(...)<br/>ret"]
    B2 --> R2["trace_ret(...)<br/>ret"]
    B3 --> MT["musttail call,<br/>and the ret forwarding it"]
    MT --> NI["not instrumented:<br/>call and ret must stay adjacent"]
    IB --> NR["no trace_ret:<br/>an inlined callee has no ret"]

    N["a frame's calls can sit later than its start:<br/>pushed past every value they report,<br/>then clamped back by legalInsertionPt()"]
    N -.- A0
